<div class="page-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Kapasitas akun</p>
    <h1>Storage</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">File di Trash tetap menggunakan kapasitas sampai dihapus permanen.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/app/items/new">
    <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg>
    Tambah item
  </a>
</div>

<div class="storage-layout">
  <section class="panel storage-hero">
    <div class="storage-hero-head">
      <span class="stat-icon stat-icon-violet"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-hard-drive"></use></svg></span>
      <div>
        <h2>Penggunaan storage</h2>
        <p data-storage-status>Menghitung…</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="storage-meter-large">
      <div class="storage-bar storage-bar-xl" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" data-storage-page-bar>
        <span class="storage-bar-fill" data-storage-page-fill></span>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-meter-labels">
        <span><strong data-storage-page-percent>—</strong> terpakai</span>
        <span data-storage-page-numbers>—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="storage-breakdown">
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <span class="breakdown-dot breakdown-dot-file"></span>
        <div><p>File item</p><strong data-storage-file-size>—</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <span class="breakdown-dot breakdown-dot-trash"></span>
        <div><p>File di Trash</p><strong data-storage-trash-size>—</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <span class="breakdown-dot breakdown-dot-free"></span>
        <div><p>Tersisa</p><strong data-storage-free-size>—</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notice" data-storage-warning hidden>
      <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-alert"></use></svg>
      <span data-storage-warning-text></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <div>
        <h2>Cara menghemat ruang</h2>
        <p>Beberapa langkah sederhana.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="tip-list">
      <li><span class="tip-number">1</span><div><strong>Kosongkan Trash</strong><p>Item di Trash masih memakai storage. Hapus permanen jika sudah tidak diperlukan.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="tip-number">2</span><div><strong>Hapus file besar</strong><p>Gunakan filter jenis Dokumen atau Gambar untuk menemukan file berukuran besar.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="tip-number">3</span><div><strong>Arsipkan, jangan hapus</strong><p>Arsip tidak menghapus file dan tidak membebaskan storage, tetapi merapikan daftar utama.</p></div></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="storage-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/app/trash">Buka Trash</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/app/items?type=document">Lihat dokumen</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
